+                        (ii) The rights derived by the holder through a foreclosure sale of real estate whether or not such rights constitute an estate in real property under local law.
+                        <PRTPAGE P="713"/>
+                    </P>
+                    <P>(j) A claim for the guaranty must include a cop(y)(ies) of a current credit report(s) on the debtor(s).</P>
+                    <PARAUTH>(Authority: 38 U.S.C. 3712)</PARAUTH>
+                    <P>
+                        (k) The provisions of this section shall not be in derogation of any rights which the Secretary may have under § 36.4286. The Under Secretary for Benefits, or the Executive Director, Loan Guaranty Service, may authorize any deviation from the provisions of this section, within the limitations prescribed in 38 U.S.C. chapter 37, which may be necessary or desirable to accomplish the objectives of this section if such deviation is made necessary by reason of any laws or practice in any State, Territory, or the District of Columbia: 
