+                </P>
+                <P>(A) The materiality and importance of the false certification to the determination to issue the guaranty or to approve the assumption;</P>
+                <P>(B) The frequency and past pattern of such false certifications by the lender; and</P>
+                <P>(C) Any exculpatory or mitigating circumstances.</P>
+                <P>
