+                    <E T="03">Defendant.</E>
+                     Defendant means a lender named in the complaint.
+                    <PRTPAGE P="778"/>
+                </P>
+                <P>
+                    (iv) 
+                    <E T="03">Lender.</E>
+                     Lender includes the holder approving loan assumptions pursuant to 38 U.S.C. 3714.
