+
+
+<div id="" class="opener " style="">
+  <h2>Our Vision</h2>
+  
+
+
+<p id="" class="" style="">
+  Within the next five years the Horry County Veterans Affairs Office will become a model for all County Veterans Affairs Offices in the state of South Carolina. We will engage in a culture of excellence by providing Veterans and survivors with accurate information on VA benefits and programs; treat all clients with dignity and respect; respond timely to all communication; provide innovative computer service for Veterans to electronically enroll in VA programs and continually increase our knowledge on the multitude of VA benefits.
+</p>
+</div>
+  </div>
+</div>
+
