+<h2>Registration Requirements (Vehicle, boats, campers, etc.)</h2>
+<p>New Purchase - Bill of Sale or Title (front &amp; back) - Out of State Transfer – Current Registration or Title You must also provide proof of your current residential address. </p>
+<p>Acceptable Documents (must show your name and residential address — no P.O. Boxes):</p>
+<ul>
+<li>A valid ID/Driver’s license (DL)</li>
+</ul>
+<p>AND one of the following:</p>
+<ul>
+<li>Recent utility bill (electric, water, gas, internet, etc.)</li>
+<li>Voter registration card </li>
+<li>State or federal tax documents </li>
+<li>Mortgage closing papers </li>
+<li>Current school attendance records </li>
+<li>Lease or rental agreement </li>
+</ul>
+<p>All documents must be current and include your name and physical address.</p>
