+	(C) If the credit exceeds the taxpayer&#39;s tax liability for the taxable year, the excess amount may be carried forward for credit against income taxes in the next five succeeding taxable years.<br /><br />
+	(D) To qualify for the credit the taxpayer must obtain a construction permit issued by the Department of Environmental Services or proof of exemption from permit requirements issued by the department, the Natural Resources Conservation Service, or a local Soil and Water Conservation District.<br /><br />
