s of the taxpayer, does not exceed the taxpayer&#39;s total state income tax liability for the taxable year. The fair market value of qualified donations made pursuant to this section must be substantiated by a &quot;qualified appraisal&quot; prepared by a &quot;qualified appraiser&quot; as those terms are defined under applicable federal law and regulations applicable to charitable contributions.<br /><br />
