+	(G) Nothing in this section may be construed to allow an employer to claim this credit for a formerly incarcerated individual if the individual was hired before 2022.<br /><br />
+	(H) For purposes of this section:<br /><br />
+	(1) &quot;Full-time&quot; has the same meaning as provided in Section 12-6-3360.<br /><br />
