+              <div class="field__item">      <div id="body-31331" class="paragraph paragraph--id--31331 paragraph--type--body paragraph--view-mode--default body">
+      <div class="wrap">
+            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Apply as an organization</h4><p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://mydorway.dor.sc.gov/?link=PT401O">organizations - apply now</a></p><p><strong>Organizations</strong> also have the option to apply by printing, completing, and mailing in the Property Exemption Application for Organizations (<a href="/sites/dor/files/forms/PT401O.pdf"><strong>PT-40​1O</strong></a>)​​ to the address listed on the form (or bring your completed application to one of our <a href="/contact-us/locations" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="fba17cb3-99a4-4608-96d8-dfd8f8d0ed28" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Locations"><strong>Taxpayer Assistance Offices</strong></a>).&nbsp;</p></div>
