+          <h1 class="blog-title"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Veterans - learn more about SC Property Tax exemptions</span>
+</h1>
+    
+    <p class="blog-date">Tuesday, Nov 4, 2025</p>
+
+          
+            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><div>
+  
+  
+<div class="media-field content-field field-media-image animate-children field-type--image" data-item-count="1">
+
+      <div class="field-label visually-hidden">Image</div>
+  
+      <div data-item="0">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/dor/files/styles/image_crop/public/2025-06/Tax%20Tips_Web%20Banner-1.png?itok=qXr1qo9N" width="1201" height="201" alt="SCDOR Tax tips, light bulb" class="image-style-image-crop">
+
+
+</div>
+  
+</div>
+
+</div>
+<p>More than 386,000 military veterans live in South Carolina, according to the U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs. The SCDOR encourages qualifying South Carolina veterans to learn more about Property Tax exemptions on both real and personal property.</p></div>
+      
+      <div class="field field--name-field-container field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden accordion field__items" id="adhoc-html-accordion-node-4241-field-container">
