tedCondition":"overweight, obesity, diabetes, high blood pressure","fieldReferralRequired":"2","fieldTricareDescription":null,"description":"We offer easy-to-follow weight management plans backed by the latest science. Our experts can help you reduce health risks, prevent or reverse some diseases\u0026nbsp;and live a better—and even longer—life.","entityId":"23e2fff7-c703-423a-ad4f-f163209c1866","entityBundle":"health_care_local_health_service","fieldBody":"\u003cp\u003eMOVE! is a weight-management program designed to help you live a longer, healthier life. With the help of your MOVE! care team, you can eat a healthier diet, get more exercise, reduce your health risks, and improve your quality of life. The MOVE! program offers:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight-loss support groups to help you lose weight and keep it off\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHealthy eating tips and cooking classes\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBehavioral change strategies to help you live a healthier lifestyle\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.move.va.gov/\"\u003eLearn more about MOVE!\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","isMentalHealthService":false,"locations":[{"type":"paragraph--service_location","id":"35b308c2-608d-4fb4-997a-6ad57b8e43cc","officeVisits":null,"virtualSupport":null,"apptIntroTextType":"use_default_text","apptIntroTextCustom":null,"appointmentPhoneNumbers":[],"onlineSchedulingAvail":null,"contactInfoPhoneNumbers":[],"emailContacts":[],"hours":"0","officeHours":[],"additionalHoursInfo":null,"useMainFacilityPhone":true,"useFacilityPhoneNumber":true,"serviceLocationAddress":{"type":"paragraph--service_location_address","id":"40a40d15-ed3b-48e0-8c85-7973af4e6ba0","drupal_internal__id":46243,"drupal_internal__revision_id":1319799,"langcode":"en","status":true,"created":"2021-06-09T20:16:43+00:00","parent_id":"46244","parent_type":"paragraph","parent_field_name":"field_service_location_address","behavior_settings":[],"default_langcode":true,"revision_translation_affected":null,"breadcrumbs":[],"content_translation_source":"und","content_translation_outdated":false,"content_translation_changed":null,"field_address":{"langcode":null,"country_code":"US","administrative_area":"","locality":"","dependent_locality":null,"postal_code":"","sorting_code":null,"address_line1":"","address_line2":null},"field_building_name_number":null,"field_clinic_name":null,"field_use_facility_address":true,"field_wing_floor_or_room_number":null,"links":{"self":{"href":"https://prod.cms.va.gov/jsonapi/paragraph/service_location_address/40a40d15-ed3b-48e0-8c85-7973af4e6ba0?resourceVersion=id%3A1319799"},"working-copy":{"href":"https://prod.cms.va.gov/jsonapi/paragraph/service_location_address/40a40d15-ed3b-48e0-8c85-7973af4e6ba0?resourceVersion=rel%3Aworking-copy"}},"resourceIdObjMeta":{"target_revision_id":1319799,"drupal_internal__target_id":46243},"paragraph_type":{"type":"paragraphs_type--paragraphs_type","id":"bd794386-a382-48d0-84fb-47290c3c1176","resourceIdObjMeta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":"service_location_address"}},"relationshipNames":["paragraph_type"]}}],"fieldFacilityLocatorApiId":"vha_534","fieldHealthServiceApiId":"weightManagement"},{"name":"My HealtheVet coordinator","fieldAlsoKnownAs":"","fieldCommonlyTreatedCondition":"","fieldReferralRequired":"2","fieldTricareDescription":null,"description":"Your My HealtheVet coordinator can help you start using the VA online portal to manage your appointments and records, refill prescriptions, view your lab and test results\u0026nbsp;and communicate with your health care team.","entityId":"603b9ef3-2516-4acc-ae25-ad1fc2ec6291","entityBundle":"health_care_local_health_service","fieldBody":"\u003cp\u003eMy HealtheVet is a web-based tool you can use to manage your care and improve your health from your computer or mobile device. You can access your personal health records and use tools to manage your care through our My HealtheVet online system. You can also use My HealtheVet to refill your prescriptions, track appointments, and read informative health articles. If you need help using My HealtheVet, you can contact our coordinator by phone or in person. With My HealtheVet, you can:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAsk questions and exchange secure online messages with your VA health care team\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCheck your lab and test results\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefill your prescriptions, track delivery, and view a list of your medications\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKeep track of your VA medical appointments and get email reminders\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eView, download, or print a copy of your VA medical records\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEnter or update your personal information\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://www.va.gov/health-care/manage-health/\"\u003eLearn more and register for My HealtheVet\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","isMentalHealthService":false,"locations":[{"type":"paragraph--service_location","id":"91445626-8976-44a6-8fbf-8ff649260b1e","officeVisits":null,"virtualSupport":null,"apptIntroTextType":"use_default_text","apptIntroTextCustom":null,"appointmentPhoneNumbers":[],"onlineSchedulingAvail":null,"contactInfoPhoneNumbers":[],"emailContacts":[],"hours":"0","officeHours":[],"additionalHoursInfo":null,"useMainFacilityPhone":true,"useFacilityPhoneNumber":true,"serviceLocationAddress":{"type":"paragraph--service_location_address","id":"d4bad85b-b082-4c44-a9cb-71371313b1ec","drupal_internal__id":46245,"drupal_internal__revision_id":1319801,"langcode":"en","status":true,"created":"2021-06-09T20:16:43+00:00","parent_id":"46246","parent_type":"paragraph","parent_field_name":"field_service_location_address","behavior_settings":[],"default_langcode":true,"revision_translation_affected":null,"breadcrumbs":[],"content_translation_source":"und","content_translation_outdated":false,"content_translation_changed":null,"field_address":{"langcode":null,"country_code":"US","administrative_area":"","locality":"","dependent_locality":null,"postal_code":"","sorting_code":null,"address_line1":"","address_line2":null},"field_building_name_number":null,"field_clinic_name":null,"field_use_facility_address":true,"field_wing_floor_or_room_number":null,"links":{"self":{"href":"https://prod.cms.va.gov/jsonapi/paragraph/service_location_address/d4bad85b-b082-4c44-a9cb-71371313b1ec?resourceVersion=id%3A1319801"},"working-copy":{"href":"https://prod.cms.va.gov/jsonapi/paragraph/service_location_address/d4bad85b-b082-4c44-a9cb-71371313b1ec?resourceVersion=rel%3Aworking-copy"}},"resourceIdObjMeta":{"target_revision_id":1319801,"drupal_internal__target_id":46245},"paragraph_type":{"type":"paragraphs_type--paragraphs_type","id":"bd794386-a382-48d0-84fb-47290c3c1176","resourceIdObjMeta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":"service_location_address"}},"relationshipNames":["paragraph_type"]}}],"fieldFacilityLocatorApiId":"vha_534","fieldHealthServiceApiId":"myHealtheVetCoordinator"},{"name":"Nutrition, food, and dietary care","fieldAlsoKnownAs":"","fieldCommonlyTreatedCondition":"","fieldReferralRequired":"2","fieldTricareDescription":null,"description":"Our nutrition experts work closely with you and your care team to help make sure you’re getting the nutrition you need to get and stay as healthy as possible.","entityId":"747057bc-2203-4100-ae67-9de02cdeac94","entityBundle":"health_care_local_health_service","fieldBody":"\u003cp\u003eOur registered dietitians can help you maintain or improve your health with good nutrition tailored to your needs. Through group, individual, and telehealth sessions, we provide nutrition education and counseling in areas such as:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCardiovascular and heart health\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChronic kidney disease\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDiabetes (including gestational diabetes)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEating disorders and digestive health\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePregnancy and postpartum nutrition\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight management\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n","isMentalHealthService":false,"locations":[{"type":"paragraph--service_location","id":"0c357ebc-8e66-47ea-bd3a-ef14935cac46","officeVisits":null,"virtualSupport":null,"apptIntroTextType":"use_default_text","apptIntroTextCustom":null,"appointmentPhoneNumbers":[],"onlineSchedulingAvail":null,"contactInfoPhoneNumbers":[],"emailContacts":[],"hours":"0","officeHours":[],"additionalHoursInfo":null,"useMainFacilityPhone":true,"useFacilityPhoneNumber":true,"serviceLocationAddress":{"type":"paragraph--service_location_address","id":"b7103aff-1a58-4766-a6ed-b5ced2f5bc5c","drupal_internal__id":46247,"drupal_internal__revision_id":1319803,"langcode":"en","status":true,"created":"2021-06-09T20:16:43+00:00","parent_id":"46248","parent_type":"paragraph","parent_field_name":"field_service_location_address","behavior_settings":[],"default_langcode":true,"revision_translation_affected":null,"breadcrumbs":[],"content_translation_source":"und","content_translation_outdated":false,"content_translation_changed":null,"field_address":{"langcode":null,"country_code":"US","administrative_area":"","locality":"","dependent_locality":null,"postal_code":"","sorting_code":null,"address_line1":"","address_line2":null},"field_building_name_number":null,"field_clinic_name":null,"field_use_facility_address":true,"field_wing_floor_or_room_number":null,"links":{"self":{"href":"https://prod.cms.va.gov/jsonapi/paragraph/service_location_address/b7103aff-1a58-4766-a6ed-b5ced2f5bc5c?resourceVersion=id%3A1319803"},"working-copy":{"href":"https://prod.cms.va.gov/jsonapi/paragraph/service_location_address/b7103aff-1a58-4766-a6ed-b5ced2f5bc5c?resourceVersion=rel%3Aworking-copy"}},"resourceIdObjMeta":{"target_revision_id":1319803,"drupal_internal__target_id":46247},"paragraph_type":{"type":"paragraphs_type--paragraphs_type","id":"bd794386-a382-48d0-84fb-47290c3c1176","resourceIdObjMeta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":"service_location_address"}},"relationshipNames":["paragraph_type"]}}],"fieldFacilityLocatorApiId":"vha_534","fieldHealthServiceApiId":"nutrition"},{"name":"Pain management","fieldAlsoKnownAs":"","fieldCommonlyTreatedCondition":"","fieldReferralRequired":"hide","fieldTricareDescription":null,"description":"If you are in pain, we work with you and your health care team to find the best way to treat and manage it.","entityId":"bf3a04a8-8940-4ca1-b99b-e183bf291e13","entityBundle":"health_care_local_health_service","fieldBody":"\u003cp\u003eChronic (long-lasting) pain can make it hard to enjoy life, but effective pain management can help! Chronic pain occurs when a person suffers from pain in a particular area of the body for at least three to six months. This type of pain lasts beyond the normal amount of time that an injury takes to heal and can come from many things, including normal wear and tear, aging, and other medical conditions. Our pain experts work with you, your Primary Care Provider (PCP), and other specialists to create a plan to help you manage your pain, increase daily functioning, and improve your quality of life!\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;Although much of the treatment for chronic pain occurs in primary care, the Comprehensive Pain Management Clinic is available for consultation and treatment of complex cases.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComprehensive evaluation and treatment planning by an interdisciplinary team of Anesthesiologists/Physiatrists (MD), Physician Assistants (PA), \u0026amp; Nurse Practitioners (NP)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePain Pharmacists (PharmD) - Prescribing and optimizing your use of medications, reducing the risk of unintended side effects, and ordering complimentary treatments when necessary\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePain Psychologists (PhD) and pain Social Workers- Offering evidence-based psychological treatments: \u003ca href=\"https://www.va.gov/PAINMANAGEMENT/CBT_CP/Veterans.asp\"\u003eCognitive-Behavioral Therapy for Chronic Pain (CBT-CP)\u003c/a\u003e and Acceptance and Commitment Therapy for Chronic Pain (ACT) , aimed at improving quality of life and reducing interference from chronic pain\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePain Physical Therapy (PT) — Developing an individualized program for self-management of bone, muscle, and joint pain to improve safety and quality of life.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorking with \u003ca href=\"https://www.va.gov/wholehealth/\"\u003eWhole Health\u003c/a\u003e tools that include but are not limited to: meditation, mindfulness training, relaxation, recreational therapy yoga, anti-inflammatory diet and tai chi to help you manage your pain\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReferral for complimentary and alternative treatments but are not limited to: including acupuncture, chiropractic care, \u0026nbsp;Tai-Chi, biofeedback, aquatherapy, and massage therapy.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n","isMentalHealthService":false,"locations":[{"type":"paragraph--service_location","id":"745c2cc6-5a7b-488b-88fc-21c2b2c5ec8c","officeVisits":null,"virtualSupport":null,"apptIntroTextType":"use_default_text","apptIntroTextCustom":null,"appointmentPhoneNumbers":[],"onlineSchedulingAvail":null,"contactInfoPhoneNumbers":[],"emailContacts":[],"hours":"0","officeHours":[],"additionalHoursInfo":null,"useMainFacilityPhone":true,"useFacilityPhoneNumber":true,"serviceLocationAddress":{"type":"paragraph--service_location_address","id":"40b21e99-0151-4f90-b5aa-4434e4653155","drupal_internal__id":104911,"drupal_internal__revision_id":2176033,"langcode":"en","status":true,"created":"2022-03-02T14:06:57+00:00","parent_id":"104912","parent_type":"paragraph","parent_field_name":"field_service_location_address","behavior_settings":[],"default_langcode":true,"revision_translation_affected":null,"breadcrumbs":[],"content_translation_source":"und","content_translation_outdated":false,"content_translation_changed":null,"field_address":{"langcode":null,"country_code":"US","administrative_area":"","locality":"","dependent_locality":null,"postal_code":"","sorting_code":null,"address_line1":"","address_line2":""},"field_building_name_number":null,"field_clinic_name":null,"field_use_facility_address":true,"field_wing_floor_or_room_number":null,"links":{"self":{"href":"https://prod.cms.va.gov/jsonapi/paragraph/service_location_address/40b21e99-0151-4f90-b5aa-4434e4653155?resourceVersion=id%3A2176033"},"working-copy":{"href":"https://prod.cms.va.gov/jsonapi/paragraph/service_location_address/40b21e99-0151-4f90-b5aa-4434e4653155?resourceVersion=rel%3Aworking-copy"}},"resourceIdObjMeta":{"target_revision_id":2176033,"drupal_internal__target_id":104911},"paragraph_type":{"type":"paragraphs_type--paragraphs_type","id":"bd794386-a382-48d0-84fb-47290c3c1176","resourceIdObjMeta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":"service_location_address"}},"relationshipNames":["paragraph_type"]}}],"fieldFacilityLocatorApiId":"vha_534","fieldHealthServiceApiId":"painManagement"},{"name":"Palliative and hospice care","fieldAlsoKnownAs":"Serious illness, hospice and end-of-life care","fieldCommonlyTreatedCondition":"","fieldReferralRequired":"2","fieldTricareDescription":null,"description":"Palliative care focuses on comfort, quality of life\u0026nbsp;and reducing suffering. Hospice care is a type of palliative care offered to patients with life-threatening illness under certain conditions.","entityId":"9c776ab0-3db4-4a94-8dca-520311e65a89","entityBundle":"health_care_local_health_service","fieldBody":"\u003cp\u003eOur palliative and hospice care services support you and your family as you cope with a life-threatening or terminal illness. Palliative care works to provide comfort, reduce suffering, and improve the quality of life for patients being treated for serious illnesses. Hospice care focuses on helping patients with terminal illnesses to manage the final stages of their lives. Our palliative and hospice care services include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePain and symptom management\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEmotional, spiritual, and psychosocial support for you and your family\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHelp with practical issues that include an advance directive (living will), health care power of attorney, funeral arrangements, and applying for VA death and burial benefits\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEducation to help you and your family make informed health care decisions and know what to expect as your health declines\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBereavement care to help surviving family members during the grieving process\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n","isMentalHealthService":false,"locations":[{"type":"paragraph--service_location","id":"975f397d-6642-4091-b1f5-a99962e95def","officeVisits":null,"virtualSupport":null,"apptIntroTextType":"use_default_text","apptIntroTextCustom":null,"appointmentPhoneNumbers":[],"onlineSchedulingAvail":null,"contactInfoPhoneNumbers":[],"emailContacts":[],"hours":"0","officeHours":[],"additionalHoursInfo":null,"useMainFacilityPhone":true,"useFacilityPhoneNumber":true,"serviceLocationAddress":{"type":"paragraph--service_location_address","id":"059f4847-00e5-4f34-9b7d-54c678ef0dd6","drupal_internal__id":46235,"drupal_internal__revision_id":1319790,"langcode":"en","status":true,"created":"2021-06-09T20:16:43+00:00","parent_id":"46236","parent_type":"paragraph","parent_field_name":"field_service_location_address","behavior_settings":[],"default_langcode":true,"revision_translation_affected":null,"breadcrumbs":[],"content_translation_source":"und","content_translation_outdated":false,"content_translation_changed":null,"field_address":{"langcode":null,"country_code":"US","administrative_area":"","locality":"","dependent_locality":null,"postal_code":"","sorting_code":null,"address_line1":"","address_line2":null},"field_building_name_number":null,"field_clinic_name":null,"field_use_facility_address":true,"field_wing_floor_or_room_number":null,"links":{"self":{"href":"https://prod.cms.va.gov/jsonapi/paragraph/service_location_address/059f4847-00e5-4f34-9b7d-54c678ef0dd6?resourceVersion=id%3A1319790"},"working-copy":{"href":"https://prod.cms.va.gov/jsonapi/paragraph/service_location_address/059f4847-00e5-4f34-9b7d-54c678ef0dd6?resourceVersion=rel%3Aworking-copy"}},"resourceIdObjMeta":{"target_revision_id":1319790,"drupal_internal__target_id":46235},"paragraph_type":{"type":"paragraphs_type--paragraphs_type","id":"bd794386-a382-48d0-84fb-47290c3c1176","resourceIdObjMeta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":"service_location_address"}},"relationshipNames":["paragraph_type"]}}],"fieldFacilityLocatorApiId":"vha_534","fieldHealthServiceApiId":"hospice"},{"name":"Patient advocates","fieldAlsoKnownAs":"","fieldCommonlyTreatedCondition":"","fieldReferralRequired":"2","fieldTricareDescription":"Please contact our patient advocates if you have any compliments, complaints, or concerns.","description":"VA wants to make sure that you get the best possible care. If you need help finding care or getting problems resolved, please contact a patient advocate.","entityId":"92af8822-30da-4bbf-a57d-e9d5a0a49f77","entityBundle":"health_care_local_health_service","fieldBody":"\u003cp\u003eOur patient advocates work hard to make sure you receive the best possible care at our health care facilities. They can:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHelp you get answers or address concerns with your care team\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdvocate for patient and family rights\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eServe as advocates for minority Veterans, women Veterans, and Veterans with disabilities\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffer specialized help to former prisoners of war and Veterans transitioning from Operation Enduring Freedom (OEF), Operation Iraqi Freedom (OIF), and Operation New Dawn (OND)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca data-entity-substit